# Public domain: words by Fanny Crosby (1873).
{title: Blessed Assurance}
{subtitle: Jesus Is Mine}
{artist: Fanny Crosby}
{copyright: Public Domain}
{key: D}
{tempo: 100}
{time: 9/8}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Blessed assurance, [G]Jesus is [D]mine!
O what a foretaste of [E7]glory di[A]vine!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]This is my story, [G]this is my [D]song,
Praising my Saviour [A7]all the day [D]long;
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Perfect submission, perfect delight,
Visions of rapture now burst on my sight;
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
